        "06": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/087006.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "arab": "إِلَّا مَا شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ يَعْلَمُ ٱلْجَهْرَ وَمَا يَخْفَىٰ",
      "arab_kemenag": "اِلَّا مَا شَاۤءَ اللّٰهُ ۗاِنَّهٗ يَعْلَمُ الْجَهْرَ وَمَا يَخْفٰىۗ ",
      "latin": "Illā mā syā'allāh(u), innahū ya‘lamul-jahra wa mā yakhfā.",
      "translation_id": "kecuali jika Allah menghendaki. Sesungguhnya Dia mengetahui yang terang dan yang tersembunyi.",
      "translation_en": "Except what Allah should will. Indeed, He knows what is declared and what is hidden.",
      "audio": {
        "01": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/087007.mp3",
        "02": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdul-Muhsin-Al-Qasim/087007.mp3",
        "03": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdurrahman-as-Sudais/087007.mp3",
        "04": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Ibrahim-Al-Dossari/087007.mp3",
        "05": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Misyari-Rasyid-Al-Afasi/087007.mp3",
        "06": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/087007.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "arab": "وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرَىٰ",
      "arab_kemenag": "وَنُيَسِّرُكَ لِلْيُسْرٰىۖ ",
      "latin": "Wa nuyassiruka lil-yusrā.",
      "translation_id": "Kami akan melapangkan bagimu jalan kemudahan (dalam segala urusan).",
      "translation_en": "And We will ease you toward ease.",
