      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "arab": "فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ",
      "arab_kemenag": "فَذَكِّرْ اِنْ نَّفَعَتِ الذِّكْرٰىۗ ",
      "latin": "Fa żakkir in nafa‘atiż-żikrā.",
      "translation_id": "Maka, sampaikanlah peringatan jika peringatan itu bermanfaat.",
      "translation_en": "So remind, if the reminder should benefit;",
